{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "totalVI 的输入是 RNA 与蛋白的 UMI 计数矩阵，与你提供的 RNA、蛋白均为 UMI counts 一致。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "The input to totalVI consists of the matrices of RNA and protein unique molecular identifier (UMI) counts (Fig. 1a)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "批次或供体等分类协变量是用于整合数据集的输入，但属于可选输入。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Categorical covariates such as experimental batch or donor are optional inputs used for integrating datasets and referred to henceforth as “batch”."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "totalVI 明确支持对配对转录组/蛋白分析进行批次整合，缺失蛋白的整合被单独处理。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "totalVI can be used for disparate analysis tasks including joint dimensionality reduction, dataset integration (with and without missing proteins), protein background correction, estimation of correlations between genes and/or proteins, and differential expression testing."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的是两个 CITE-seq 批次，但未说明两个批次是否使用相同抗体 panel，因此不能直接断言当前数据满足同一 panel 或不同 panel 的适用条件。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：来源允许不同抗体 panel 以及仅含 scRNA-seq 的子集，因此不能把“每个细胞都必须有蛋白测量”当作硬性输入要求。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "Input datasets can have different antibody panels, and a subset can be scRNA-seq datasets (i.e., without proteins)."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：缺失蛋白的整合依赖批次索引来刻画蛋白缺失模式，并假设所有批次共享同一组基因；这不代表对任意缺失模式都有插补保证。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 7,
          "quote": "As any single batch may correspond to an experiment that used a different protein panel (or no proteins in the case of a scRNA-seq experiment), the missingness of protein features depends on the batch index sn. Further, suppose all batches share the same set of genes."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "这两个 CITE-seq 批次是否使用相同的抗体 panel，且是否共享同一组基因？",
    "missing_field": "antibody_panel_and_gene_overlap",
    "why_needed": "这决定 totalVI 是按同一 panel 的配对蛋白建模，还是需要按批次索引处理蛋白缺失；同时共享基因假设会影响缺失蛋白整合的适用边界。"
  }
}
